### Set lineup for a club in a match (replace with actual IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lineups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchId": "REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_ID",
  "clubId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID_1",
  "playerIds": [
    "REPLACE_WITH_PLAYER_ID_1",
    "REPLACE_WITH_PLAYER_ID_2",
    "REPLACE_WITH_PLAYER_ID_3"
  ]
}

### Get full match lineups (both clubs) - replace with actual match ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lineups/match/REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_ID

### Get lineup for a specific club in a match (replace with actual IDs)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lineups/match/REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_ID?clubId=REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID_1
